  "display_title": "Do or Die: Girls Get Along Great",
  "description": "When Pat-Ji discovers that her new stepfather is cheating on her mother, she develops a secret loathing for both him and his biological daughter, Kong-Ji. Unfortunately, as a red-blooded lesbian, Pat-Ji also feels a strong attraction to her stepsister. Driven by both hatred and desire, Pat-Ji ends up harassing Kong-Ji despite the latter’s efforts to form a friendly bond between them. Perhaps that’s why karma comes for her hard in the form of a mysterious warning: Pat-Ji will die in 3 days… unless she has sex with a man.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of RIDI's Sengmotjung Danpyeonseon (섹못죽 단편선) Collection.*",
